        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Chuck Daly, Doc Rivers, Yanni Hufnagel\n- Teams: Orlando Magic, United States men's Olympic basketball team\n- Roles: Assistant coach, head coach\n- Events: 1992 Summer Olympics, 1997–98 Orlando Magic season\n\nFacts:\n- Chuck Daly led the United States men's Olympic basketball team to the gold medal at the 1992 Summer Olympics.\n- Chuck Daly was the head coach of the Orlando Magic during the 1997–98 season.\n- Doc Rivers served with the Orlando Magic, and an assistant coach worked under him.\n- Yanni Hufnagel served under Chuck Daly as a coach.",
